                <syl /><neume facs="#m-ee7e6437-6d06-43ef-a92e-1a6c70dafac2" type="punctum" xml:id="m-ddf03466-7c16-40f3-a9a2-13a0a92da500">
                  <nc xml:id="m-0bd36081-faaf-4d93-9b95-c14501e53e27" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-6c93ed06-1955-4443-ad56-90c76229d206">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-3a130b3f-c952-48bb-83aa-f52c1e22723c" type="punctum" xml:id="m-effacd8f-df83-40b6-a311-ce467b3a4f98">
                  <nc xml:id="m-63e3188a-d829-43bc-ba68-304c665cf6af" pname="g" oct="3"><episema xml:id="m-b32604ce-3421-4874-8d3e-93f6929dbe24" form="v" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-f853ebcd-66ec-41af-9212-bb2b96153c5b" facs="#m-36440742-40f0-45a0-a0a1-f2f7ffd682ae" form="maior" /><custos xml:id="m-1f576710-5110-4a98-be91-69e150ee75b0" facs="#m-b4396ed2-df24-42fc-9c78-436acf94a07f" pname="a" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-bb006a42-da85-4bd9-adeb-c1191e35528c">
            <lg xml:id="m-d39016db-6589-4115-a045-2dfa828d36b3">
              <l xml:id="m-3da7abfb-3afa-429b-ae21-10854c6cb917" facs="#m-f3448390-4098-458e-9d28-4e8ddf985810" label="ambiguous">1322</l><l xml:id="m-1472f081-4711-453f-82b7-00a13b3b10c3" facs="#m-76f911f2-8121-411a-a90f-b3901ad4cef2" label="ambiguous">December IO. 11. 13.</l><l xml:id="m-85e482f2-5ee7-4959-8979-8ee4ef5685be" facs="#m-900119be-a96d-4317-b4a8-24273d8a4eab" label="lyrics-like">antíqui, alle- lú-ia. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-1a939c4d-3bb7-4a54-b6bc-0d55c4a7ce57" facs="#m-731f6949-12a1-4c00-9760-23013f43b12b" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. I. f. p. 207, or p. 213.</l><l xml:id="m-34fb0f79-deb5-4cb0-98e7-e86efe391ac5" facs="#m-5ab513c8-ed0b-4df7-9781-f5b0e1aee477" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus, qui per Immaculátam. p. 1317.</l><l xml:id="m-ed9e870d-83c9-4ad8-b146-0c6949a4b2e7" facs="#m-75cc671d-39fd-484d-8def-0b9d0c68c3bd" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of the Feria, p. 1080. Y. Roráte. 1080.</l><l xml:id="m-fb1f5f6b-bffe-40ba-8626-09db7dd0abc3" facs="#m-2ca93377-c222-49cc-a451-0fa5e38e448e" label="text-like">Throughout the Octave, the Ofice is said as on the Feast itself.</l><l xml:id="m-d17541a6-64b8-42fd-b886-6464434356aa" facs="#m-db62d60c-58aa-4428-84cd-fff1be068997" label="text-like">10. Commemoration of St. Melchiades. Pope and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-d03c21f4-ba13-4f85-8f36-c4c728e61e44" facs="#m-df4374a6-4e23-481a-8ee7-d9e12c95037d" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-874b2a15-ffff-43b3-98d2-3dfa305428df" facs="#m-961d7265-76cb-44cc-a196-fc9116c17578" label="lyrics-like">Regem tuum, Pastor aetérne, (perpétua protectióne custódi;</l><l xml:id="m-5db41089-98ff-4398-972e-0c3ca58f3492" facs="#m-82f5d368-8231-43ec-b4e9-b3b9c78a6690" label="lyrics-like">quem totius Ecclésiae praestitisti</l><l xml:id="m-ad32a2ae-9695-493a-868b-35e56dd0c07d" facs="#m-a7862b1d-559b-431d-8169-00bb901268c0" label="lyrics-like">( placátus inténde: t et per</l><l xml:id="m-46423c9e-499e-4d28-bea9-7e1fe3d27b0a" facs="#m-6d6586a5-8511-4fb4-909f-cd2b51ec9bd8" label="lyrics-like">beátum Melchiadem Mártyrem esse pastórem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-f1752328-e167-4ed7-8cc2-a91bd69b4ac5" facs="#m-5061be70-2a60-476d-a120-4e2b9ba6abf4" label="lyrics-like">tuum atque Summum Pontíficem,</l><l xml:id="m-a4d8f071-242b-4b08-806b-5289cc744c06" facs="#m-79a3d45e-f82e-4a32-93a6-ee3d109ecd56" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Oblátis. and Postcommunion. Refectióne. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-8a73ebc6-8c65-44bc-b1e3-3e937cb49ecf" facs="#m-989f257b-f0a3-4832-8295-bd3715911363" label="text-like">St. Damasus I, Pope and Confessor. Smi-double.</l><l xml:id="m-fe5fe217-ea70-4b96-8b9a-9d39955bd8f2" facs="#m-778a108b-6d01-4640-bd8f-3e08f4a3066a" label="ambiguous">11.</l><l xml:id="m-88ae4196-2e90-4def-911f-872167c5726c" facs="#m-6c71fc1b-2ae4-4c65-88e7-09a80017738e" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-64a79dfc-f3a4-42c4-942a-1bd163e8fa87" facs="#m-72aa07f3-32d5-4dbd-84de-2cc5444e32d8" label="lyrics-like">Regem tuum, Pastor aetérne,l cem, perpétua protectióne custódi;"</l><l xml:id="m-3b839dbf-daf8-451d-9119-f6b85cd349f5" facs="#m-aeb80519-d3e5-447d-a24a-bf6346fdd590" label="lyrics-like">( placátus inténde:t et per beã¬quem totius Ecclésiae praestitisti</l><l xml:id="m-71339944-cb9a-4d39-989b-5707c035aef7" facs="#m-6665870b-b1d9-4b47-a73a-cd99410444f6" label="lyrics-like">tum Dámasum Summum Pontífi-lesse pastórem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-4651d70d-3685-4f8e-80db-e54e46b8325a" facs="#m-0aaef6df-23d9-4900-89c3-09e73d494c61" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-74ccaf41-6e96-4db7-b30b-2f8c68147e0d" facs="#m-be9a1938-7fd8-4d75-bc29-66a920e44fa0" label="lyrics-like">Blátis munéribus, quaésumus profíciat ubique succéssus, et grati</l><l xml:id="m-75891e9c-c79a-4108-8631-6ca29373cd78" facs="#m-80bfbe83-676e-48dc-bd12-0f18463be3cf" label="lyrics-like">U Dómine, Ecclésiam tuam beni-fiant nómini tuo, te gubernánte,</l><l xml:id="m-45b767f6-8298-4c71-bbf3-dfe4518b088f" facs="#m-8c3042bf-18f2-4573-94e7-e6d687be7ee5" label="lyrics-like">gnus illúmina: ut, et gregis tuil pastóres. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-251093d6-0823-4d0e-9459-28285cca1c35" facs="#m-58f9ede0-04ba-49a1-98de-d7cbdb73795e" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-6a170c65-9e1e-49c6-af17-6f046672c208" facs="#m-18b802ac-128c-43af-bc4b-29be97bd2594" label="lyrics-like">Efectióne sancta enutritam gu¬ moderatióne dirécta, et increménta</l><l xml:id="m-8627dc2f-8ecb-47d7-9235-ecaf0cb2fe50" facs="#m-690f5c48-1f54-4abd-aff6-e2bcb73a3ec5" label="lyrics-like">Lt bérna, quaésumus Dómine, libertátis accipiat et in religiónis</l><l xml:id="m-8881051a-f1d6-4b00-b121-2f8d29d3a198" facs="#m-dab51e6c-4fd8-4d2f-ac1f-a7e2de6a5c44" label="lyrics-like">tuam placátus Ecclésiam:ut poténti l'integritáte persistat. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-694ad45c-c39f-4a7c-82bb-9dafb7ce7923" facs="#m-f7a4fe2c-3460-43a5-9d02-e5258a3ef110" label="text-like">St. Lucy. Virgin and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-cd3453bf-8c96-4db6-af86-769a5168166b" facs="#m-f4183747-e769-4cfc-9a20-d08525149fc4" label="ambiguous">13.</l><l xml:id="m-f1d456fb-4854-4f4b-92a0-c4cf650e34be" facs="#m-51c8a968-6a35-458c-84f4-4b975b34b16f" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-4e67b324-74e1-4849-b45d-813a3d8a9203" facs="#m-03c81748-37ca-43d4-b4d7-5256a180a635" label="text-like">At First Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-c0847d38-500f-4eb0-95db-0884954075ac" facs="#m-44fdb96f-c499-4fba-b32c-46acc244508f" label="text-like">All as at second Vespers, p. 1324, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-36c8e236-4200-4a79-8b5a-c4a580cae118" facs="#m-838c5db9-a1a3-4ffa-858b-db13fc0f7aed" label="lyrics-like">V. Spécie túa et pulchritúdine túa.</l><l xml:id="m-196dcd65-ca27-4d97-a3cd-b8e6fa5d378c" facs="#m-ef8dced2-efef-407e-90be-39042e6268e9" label="lyrics-like">H. Inténde, próspere procéde et régna.</l><l xml:id="m-72528d9f-60f0-43f5-b95e-69048735b74d" facs="#m-9866eefe-46f3-4d8c-80e9-078d6edbcb53" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-0a5b8a57-6c09-4b2a-b13a-780c0c48b518" facs="#m-c68002d4-822d-4ded-a904-429c8fa27aa7" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.f</l><l xml:id="m-88ede477-8ab1-43ef-86f1-b99d42a82444" facs="#m-84524382-7c98-453d-a8d7-acc1df646366" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-c4e2806e-5b30-4a54-a140-dc3f81f11855" facs="#m-d89418a5-1b50-4340-9084-93a7241ecd89" label="lyrics-like">N tú-a pa-ti-énti-a"“ possedísti ánimam tú-am,</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>